= V1 public title ledger =

This ledger accounts for the 162 Main-namespace titles visible in the V1 public inventory used during the V2 reconstruction. A title may survive as a canonical V2 page, Book Matter subpage, reusable Template, or compatibility redirect.

'''This ledger tracks title continuity, not line-for-line text verification.''' Pages marked with {{tl|Source status}} still require exact V1-source reconciliation before they should be described as verbatim ports.

