== Remaining generic or historical titles ==
Every title above is represented in V2 by a canonical page, reusable content object, or redirect. If a V1 page contained unique prose that was not available in the public source material accessible during reconstruction, its title continuity is preserved but its unique body must still be recovered from MediaWiki history/export before that prose can be declared fully ported.

